{"type":"after","callId":"call@86","endTime":55952.651,"result":{"snapshot":"- generic [ref=f1e2]:\n  - link \"Skip to coaching plan\" [ref=f1e3] [cursor=pointer]:\n    - /url: \"#plan-content\"\n  - banner [ref=f1e4]:\n    - link \"Return to current plan\" [ref=f1e5] [cursor=pointer]:\n      - /url: \"#now\"\n      - generic [ref=f1e6]: CR\n      - strong [ref=f1e7]: Republished Roadmap QA Golf\n    - generic [ref=f1e8]:\n      - button \"Print or save PDF\" [ref=f1e9] [cursor=pointer]\n      - button \"Close roadmap\" [ref=f1e11] [cursor=pointer]\n  - navigation \"Coaching plan sections\" [ref=f1e12]:\n    - link \"Now\" [ref=f1e13] [cursor=pointer]:\n      - /url: \"#now\"\n    - link \"Goal\" [ref=f1e14] [cursor=pointer]:\n      - /url: \"#goal\"\n    - link \"Roadmap\" [ref=f1e15] [cursor=pointer]:\n      - /url: \"#roadmap\"\n    - link \"Lessons\" [ref=f1e16] [cursor=pointer]:\n      - /url: \"#lessons\"\n    - link \"Practice\" [ref=f1e17] [cursor=pointer]:\n      - /url: \"#practice\"\n    - link \"Media\" [ref=f1e18] [cursor=pointer]:\n      - /url: \"#media\"\n    - link \"Data\" [ref=f1e19] [cursor=pointer]:\n      - /url: \"#data\"\n    - link \"Evidence\" [ref=f1e20] [cursor=pointer]:\n      - /url: \"#evidence\"\n    - link \"Timeline\" [ref=f1e21] [cursor=pointer]:\n      - /url: \"#timeline\"\n    - link \"Phase review\" [ref=f1e22] [cursor=pointer]:\n      - /url: \"#review\"\n  - main [ref=f1e23]:\n    - generic [ref=f1e24]:\n      - generic [ref=f1e25]:\n        - generic [ref=f1e26]: Now · Phase 1\n        - heading \"Centered contact at playing tempo\" [level=1] [ref=f1e27]\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e28]: Contact stability supports later trajectory and speed decisions.\n      - generic [ref=f1e29]:\n        - article [ref=f1e30]:\n          - text: Current coaching phase\n          - strong [ref=f1e31]: Own centered contact\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e32]: Create a stable strike window at controlled tempo.\n        - article [ref=f1e33]:\n          - text: Next useful action\n          - strong [ref=f1e34]: Review the plan with your coach\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e35]: Ask questions or wait before choosing a coaching package. There is no automatic renewal.\n      - blockquote [ref=f1e36]:\n        - generic [ref=f1e37]: Coach Republished roadmap's current takeaway\n        - text: “Preserve the comfortable tempo and use strike location as the immediate feedback signal. Preserve the comfortable tempo and use strike location as the immediate feedback signal. Preserve the comfortable tempo and use strike location as the immediate feedback signal.”\n    - generic [ref=f1e38]:\n      - generic [ref=f1e39]:\n        - text: Your goal\n        - heading \"Build predictable contact through a full league round.\" [level=2] [ref=f1e40]\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e41]: Play confidently without guarding against a two-way miss.\n      - generic [ref=f1e42]:\n        - article [ref=f1e43]:\n          - text: Real-life context\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e44]: Synthetic functional QA scenario for Coach Republished roadmap.\n        - article [ref=f1e45]:\n          - text: Honest boundary\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e46]: This plan supports the goal. It does not guarantee a score, result, timeline, or permanent change.\n    - generic [ref=f1e47]:\n      - generic [ref=f1e48]:\n        - text: Development roadmap\n        - heading \"Republished contact roadmap\" [level=2] [ref=f1e49]\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e50]: A directional sequence authored by your coach. Later phases can change as new evidence develops.\n      - generic [ref=f1e51]:\n        - generic [ref=f1e52]:\n          - text: Starting assessment\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e53]: Strike drifts toward the heel when transition tempo increases.\n        - generic [ref=f1e54]:\n          - text: Strengths to preserve\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e55]: Athletic setup and accurate awareness of strike location.\n        - generic [ref=f1e56]:\n          - text: Primary pattern\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e57]: Heel contact appears as transition tempo increases.\n        - generic [ref=f1e58]:\n          - text: Evidence limits\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e59]: A small indoor sample does not prove transfer to the course.\n      - list [ref=f1e60]:\n        - listitem [ref=f1e61]:\n          - generic [ref=f1e62]: \"01\"\n          - generic [ref=f1e63]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e64]: Current phase\n            - strong [ref=f1e65]: Own centered contact\n            - paragraph [ref=f1e66]: Create a stable strike window at controlled tempo.\n            - paragraph [ref=f1e67]: \"Why this phase leads: Centered contact is the narrowest observed foundation.\"\n            - generic [ref=f1e68]:\n              - text: Progress signals\n              - list [ref=f1e69]:\n                - listitem [ref=f1e70]: Centered contact repeats in a coach-reviewed set.\n        - listitem [ref=f1e71]:\n          - generic [ref=f1e72]: \"02\"\n          - generic [ref=f1e73]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e74]: Planned phase\n            - strong [ref=f1e75]: Shape trajectory\n            - paragraph [ref=f1e76]: Add launch windows without losing contact quality.\n        - listitem [ref=f1e77]:\n          - generic [ref=f1e78]: \"03\"\n          - generic [ref=f1e79]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e80]: Planned phase\n            - strong [ref=f1e81]: Choose targets\n            - paragraph [ref=f1e82]: Transfer the pattern into representative decisions.\n        - listitem [ref=f1e83]:\n          - generic [ref=f1e84]: \"04\"\n          - generic [ref=f1e85]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e86]: Planned phase\n            - strong [ref=f1e87]: Perform under pressure\n            - paragraph [ref=f1e88]: Test the pattern with scored constraints.\n    - generic [ref=f1e89]:\n      - generic [ref=f1e90]:\n        - text: Lesson chapters\n        - heading \"What mattered, in the coach's words.\" [level=2] [ref=f1e91]\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e92]: Concise chapters preserve direction without becoming a transcript or media archive. This bounded view shows up to 12 chapters, prioritizing the current phase before the newest retained history.\n      - article [ref=f1e94]:\n        - generic [ref=f1e95]:\n          - generic [ref=f1e96]: Lesson 1\n          - time [ref=f1e97]: Aug 1, 2026\n        - heading \"Updated centered-contact lesson\" [level=3] [ref=f1e98]\n        - text: Completed\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e99]: Review the centered-contact pattern after publication.\n        - generic [ref=f1e100]:\n          - term [ref=f1e101]: Coach observation\n          - definition [ref=f1e102]: Centered contact appeared more often in the final synthetic set, while higher tempo still widened the pattern. Centered contact appeared more often in the final synthetic set, while higher tempo still widened the pattern. Centered contact appeared more often in the final synthetic set, while higher tempo still widened the pattern.\n        - generic [ref=f1e103]:\n          - term [ref=f1e104]: Takeaway\n          - definition [ref=f1e105]: Preserve the comfortable tempo and use strike location as the immediate feedback signal. Preserve the comfortable tempo and use strike location as the immediate feedback signal. Preserve the comfortable tempo and use strike location as the immediate feedback signal.\n        - generic [ref=f1e106]:\n          - term [ref=f1e107]: Next check\n          - definition [ref=f1e108]: Repeat the representative set before changing the task.\n        - generic [ref=f1e109]:\n          - term [ref=f1e110]: Phase connection\n          - definition [ref=f1e111]: This lesson remains connected to the current phase priority.\n    - generic [ref=f1e112]:\n      - generic [ref=f1e113]:\n        - text: Practice direction\n        - heading \"One focused task before more complexity.\" [level=2] [ref=f1e114]\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e115]: Practice is coach-authored and should match the current phase and available evidence. This bounded view shows up to 8 items, prioritizing current-phase direction before the newest retained history.\n      - generic [ref=f1e116]:\n        - strong [ref=f1e117]: No practice task is published.\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e118]: Ask your coach what to do before adding unsourced or generic drills.\n    - generic [ref=f1e119]:\n      - generic [ref=f1e120]:\n        - text: Selected swing media\n        - heading \"Clips and images chosen by your coach.\" [level=2] [ref=f1e121]\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e122]: Nothing autoplays and Roadmap does not analyze the swing. Captions and coach context explain why each item belongs in this exact roadmap revision.\n      - generic [ref=f1e123]:\n        - strong [ref=f1e124]: No media is selected for this revision.\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e125]: The complete text-first roadmap remains available on any connection.\n    - generic [ref=f1e126]:\n      - generic [ref=f1e127]:\n        - text: Selected launch data\n        - heading \"What changed, with the coach’s interpretation.\" [level=2] [ref=f1e128]\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e129]: Only selected like-for-like metrics appear. Units are preserved exactly; missing values are never filled or converted.\n      - generic [ref=f1e130]:\n        - strong [ref=f1e131]: No launch-data comparison is published.\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e132]: Your roadmap does not need device data to remain complete and useful.\n    - generic [ref=f1e133]:\n      - generic [ref=f1e134]:\n        - text: Progress evidence\n        - heading \"Claims stay proportional to what was actually observed.\" [level=2] [ref=f1e135]\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e136]: This bounded view shows up to 20 published items, prioritizing current-phase evidence before the most recently observed retained history.\n      - generic [ref=f1e137]:\n        - strong [ref=f1e138]: No progress evidence is published.\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e139]: Absence of evidence is shown honestly; it is not filled with a prediction.\n    - generic [ref=f1e140]:\n      - generic [ref=f1e141]:\n        - text: Coaching timeline\n        - heading \"The journey, with history kept understandable.\" [level=2] [ref=f1e142]\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e143]: Lessons, practice, check-ins, evidence, measurements, reviews, and private milestones are ordered by their recorded date. Use the filter when you need a narrower view.\n      - generic [ref=f1e144]:\n        - generic [ref=f1e145]:\n          - text: Show timeline entries\n          - combobox \"Show timeline entries\" [ref=f1e146]:\n            - option \"All coaching activity\" [selected]\n            - option \"Lesson\"\n        - list [ref=f1e147]:\n          - listitem [ref=f1e148]:\n            - generic [ref=f1e150]:\n              - generic [ref=f1e151]:\n                - generic [ref=f1e152]: Lesson\n                - time [ref=f1e153]: Aug 1, 2026\n              - heading \"Updated centered-contact lesson\" [level=3] [ref=f1e154]\n              - paragraph [ref=f1e155]: Preserve the comfortable tempo and use strike location as the immediate feedback signal. Preserve the comfortable tempo and use strike location as the immediate feedback signal. Preserve the comfortable tempo and use strike location as the immediate feedback signal.\n              - generic [ref=f1e156]: \"Status: Completed\"\n    - generic [ref=f1e157]:\n      - generic [ref=f1e158]:\n        - text: Phase review\n        - heading \"What changed, what remains uncertain, and what happens next?\" [level=2] [ref=f1e159]\n      - generic [ref=f1e160]:\n        - strong [ref=f1e161]: This phase is not ready for review.\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e162]: A schedule alone does not prove that the phase objective is complete.\n      - generic [ref=f1e163]:\n        - strong [ref=f1e164]: No package is attached to this plan.\n        - paragraph [ref=f1e165]: You can ask the coach, wait, or continue practising independently.\n      - generic [ref=f1e166]:\n        - generic [ref=f1e167]:\n          - text: Choose without pressure\n          - heading \"What would you like to do next?\" [level=3] [ref=f1e168]\n          - paragraph [ref=f1e169]: Roadmap records only the choice below for Coach Republished roadmap to review. It does not send a message or treat an external visit as a sale.\n        - generic [ref=f1e170]:\n          - button \"Ask Coach Republished roadmap a question\" [ref=f1e171] [cursor=pointer]\n          - button \"Review later\" [ref=f1e172] [cursor=pointer]\n          - button \"Request reassessment\" [ref=f1e173] [cursor=pointer]\n          - button \"Practise independently\" [ref=f1e174] [cursor=pointer]\n          - button \"Not pursuing this option\" [ref=f1e175] [cursor=pointer]\n  - contentinfo [ref=f1e176]:\n    - generic [ref=f1e177]:\n      - generic [ref=f1e178]: CR\n      - generic [ref=f1e179]:\n        - strong [ref=f1e180]: Republished Roadmap QA Golf\n        - generic [ref=f1e181]: Coach-authored private development plan\n    - generic [ref=f1e182]:\n      - generic [ref=f1e183]: Updated Aug 11, 2026\n      - generic [ref=f1e184]: Access expires Aug 11, 2026"}}
